Same pattern as the Week-3+ notebook: token via env var → Colab Secret → getpass prompt (never pasted into a cell), then TABLES pointing at the hosted Parquet.

If you don't have a HF_TOKEN handy right now, skip to the local-CSV fallback cell further down instead — everything after Section 0 works off the sig dataframe regardless of which path built it.


